80430","wikidataId":"Q2680847","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:02.209Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:shiji","source:hanshu","source:zuozhuan","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:shiji-51ca88a2f253803e","query":"秦惠公","count":2,"offset":6167,"excerpt":"得復入郢。哀公立三十六年卒。太子夷公，夷公蚤死，不得立，立夷公子，是為惠公。\n\n秦惠公 (春秋)\n\n惠公元年，孔子行魯相事。五年，晉卿中行、范氏反晉，晉使智氏、趙簡子攻之，范、中行氏亡奔齊。惠公立十年卒，子悼公立。\n\n秦悼公\n\n悼公二年，齊臣田乞","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-7b5ed23927a9bbf1","query":"秦惠公","count":1,"offset":23421,"excerpt":"四\n十四\n\n500\n\n二十\n十公會齊侯於夾谷。孔子相。齊歸我地。\n四十八\n十二\n秦惠公元年彗星見。\n十六\n十七\n三十五\n二\n十九\n二\n鄭聲公勝元年鄭益弱。\n五\n十五\n\n499\n\n二十一\n十一\n四十九\n十三\n二生躁公、懷公、簡公。\n十七\n十八\n三十","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-e84af86b4cc75f1f","query":"秦惠公","count":1,"offset":3782,"excerpt":"。鄭圍陽翟。\n九\n二。三晉來伐我，至乘丘。\n三\n五\n\n399\n三。王子定奔晉。\n秦惠公元年。\n二十六。虢山崩，壅河。\n韓烈侯元年。\n趙武公元年\n三。歸榆關于鄭。\n四\n六\n\n398\n四\n二\n二十七\n二。鄭殺其相駟子陽。\n二\n四。敗鄭師，圍鄭。鄭人殺","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","query":"秦惠公","count":2,"offset":17357,"excerpt":"　　唐成公　季桓子\n\n　　　　司馬狗〔師古曰：「衞宣公臣也。見魯連子。」〕\n|　秦惠公〔哀公孫。〕\n| 蔡昭侯〔悼侯弟。〕\n|\n\n　　　觀射父〔師古曰：「觀音工喚反。」〕\n| 顏讎由　公父文伯　　晉定公〔頃公子。〕\n|\n\n　　　　大夫選　東野畢　","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zuozhuan-2a9e1e565a7d0e0e","query":"秦惠公","count":1,"offset":3034,"excerpt":"氏也．\n\n哀公四年\n\n經\n\n四年春．王二月．庚戌．盜殺蔡侯申．蔡公孫辰出奔吳．葬秦惠公．宋人執小邾子．\n\n夏．蔡殺其大夫公孫姓．公孫霍．晉人執戎蠻子赤歸于楚．城西郛．\n\n六月．辛丑．亳社災．\n\n秋．八月．甲寅．滕子結卒．\n\n冬．十有二月．葬蔡昭公","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-eefa2ef65195dddc","query":"秦惠公","count":1,"offset":7579,"excerpt":"是南平百越，北卻三晉，西伐秦，諸侯皆患楚之強，而楚之貴戚大臣多怨吳起者。\n\n3　秦惠公薨，子出公立。\n\n4　趙武侯薨，國人復立烈侯之太子章，是為敬侯。\n\n5　韓烈侯薨，子文侯立。\n\n安王十六年（乙未，西元前三八六年）\n\n1　初命齊大夫田和為諸侯。","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":6,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["同名或消歧義候選，尚未選定此人物對應的頁面。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-51ca88a2f253803e","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷005","title":"史記/卷005","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7005","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8744286","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7005?action=history","revisionId":8744286,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-31T06:59:56Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:02.348Z","sha256":"e0f3c7217c00827745a36cd9f9e550affc87b5bb618373109ad88d830da95cf0","textSha256":"eeb5fd997cd97ecd437ecb055eff330a19c60dfaa7a035c35adefba09bf4f614","expandedWikitextSha256":"e0f3c7217c00827745a36cd9f9e550affc87b5bb618373109ad88d830da95cf0","characters":10829,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.054Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/c342fa0f016a2162e8dd.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/c342fa0f016a2162e8dd.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:shiji-7b5ed23927a9bbf1","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷014","title":"史記/卷014","